Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We make the kind of film where the heroine doesn't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She just doesn't know it herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And when she realizes, it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're shooting here in the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is clean up after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave her body to Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you because we've known each other for years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can trust you.
